      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so quiet now. i walk into the kitchen and i still expect to see him sitting there, but it’s just… nothing. it’s been three months and the silence in this house is actually starting to feel heavy. like it's physically pressing down on me. i don't even know why i'm bothering with everything anymore. it feels pointless.",
